e. TSMC CoWoS is captive packaging, not an OSAT. Stuck step: packaging slots. https://t.co/2vQfQbYWkF","url":"https://x.com/secondordertkn/status/2109969965008732239"},{"author_id":"3567952932","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:36:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109911258736841051"],"id":"2109911258736841051","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"先进封装不只在台积电手里：多家预测 TSMC CoWoS 约从 2026 年底 ~13 万片/月扩到 2028 年底 ~26 万片/月；同期 spillover 流向 ASE、Amkor（合计约 11 万片 CoWoS 当量），Intel EMIB-T 约 4–4.5 万片当量，硅中介层还有 GlobalFoundries / UMC / VIS。AI 加速器堆 HBM","url":"https://x.com/_MO_DAO/status/2109911258736841051"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109853663510573056"]},"author_id":"135762800","created_at":"2026-10-13T03:48:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109853676131274978"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/tF34jprId4","end":207,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/yis9617/status/2109853676131274978/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109853663510573056","start":184,"url":"https://t.co/tF34jprId4"}]},"id":"2109853676131274978","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":31,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"대만 TSMC와 첨단 패키징 공급망 관련 중요 업데이트입니다.\n\n파워칩(PSMC), TSMC CoWoS 이어 인텔 EMIB 공급망도 진입…\"2027년 하반기 월 투입량 1만 장 목표\"\n\n현재 TSMC의 선단 파운드리와 CoWoS 어드밴스드 패키징 생산능력(CAPA)이 2026년까지 거의 풀가동 상태라는 점이 글로벌 AI 가속기 https://t.co/tF34jprId4","url":"https://x.com/yis9617/status/2109853676131274978"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2109615564050087936"]},"author_id":"2105910022710702080","created_at":"2026-10-12T12:03:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109615939658358849"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/Vtft23EXSJ","end":299,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/hans_openai/status/2109615939658358849/video/1","media_key":"13_2109615564050087936","start":276,"url":"https://t.co/Vtft23EXSJ"}]},"id":"2109615939658358849","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression